        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the full potential of the futuristic home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Latest Update:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a new futuristic space, complete with a builder mode designed for self-development within an educational game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through a tropical paradise in search of a place to build anything you want. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Futuristic space with a builder mode helps train spatial skills and empowers you to experiment today in<strong> </strong>virtual reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 universal construction elements in the catalog will allow you to build a dream home or large-scale virtual installations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new VR experience will interest for home-building enthusiasts, creative people, futurism lovers, fans of good graphics and puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Included:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builder mode;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specially designed 106 interior objects and 234 construction elements;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 interactive game objects;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ready-made example of a futuristic house;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game apps:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative tool;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon impression App;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music station App;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home atmosphere App;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Projector Mode;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165690/extras/fcbedb74b29e43a74ee99c9c24a4c695.avif?t=1785694831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165690/extras_big/fcbedb74b29e43a74ee99c9c24a4c695.avif?t=1785694831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165690/extras/cbbf446446eb04f60f481f77845ebfae.avif?t=1785694831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165690/extras_big/cbbf446446eb04f60f481f77845ebfae.avif?t=1785694831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the full potential of the futuristic home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Latest Update:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a new futuristic space, complete with a builder mode designed for self-development within an educational game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through a tropical paradise in search of a place to build anything you want. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Futuristic space with a builder mode helps train spatial skills and empowers you to experiment today in<strong> </strong>virtual reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 universal construction elements in the catalog will allow you to build a dream home or large-scale virtual installations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new VR experience will interest for home-building enthusiasts, creative people, futurism lovers, fans of good graphics and puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Included:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builder mode;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specially designed 106 interior objects and 234 construction elements;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 interactive game objects;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ready-made example of a futuristic house;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game apps:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative tool;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon impression App;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music station App;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home atmosphere App;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Projector Mode;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165690/extras/fcbedb74b29e43a74ee99c9c24a4c695.avif?t=1785694831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165690/extras_big/fcbedb74b29e43a74ee99c9c24a4c695.avif?t=1785694831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165690/extras/cbbf446446eb04f60f481f77845ebfae.avif?t=1785694831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165690/extras_big/cbbf446446eb04f60f481f77845ebfae.avif?t=1785694831 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
